OL,3,AHackers steal data from millions of
OL,4,Aairport customers
OL,5,
OL,6,FMAG told the BBC the hackers demanded a
OL,7,Fransom fee for the return of the data,
OL,8,Fwhich the group said it refused to pay.
OL,9,FThe sum of the ransom fee was not
OL,10,Fdisclosed.
OL,12,FThe firm said "at no point has
OL,13,Fpassenger safety or aviation security
OL,14,Fbeen compromised" and the system hacked
OL,15,Fdid not hold customers' bank or payment
OL,16,Fdetails.
